# A land with no counters may untap and activate for zero counters, tapping for no mana (CR 107.1c, 605.1a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Hollow Trees
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Hollow Trees.Play
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hollow Trees.Counters.Storage = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Hollow Trees.Activate(X: 0)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Hollow Trees.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Hollow Trees.Counters.Storage = (absent)
